     "source": "model_quote",
     "spans": [
      {
       "text": "In this study, we evaluated the role of the biomarkers CSF protein levels, MRI and FDG PET as available in a routine clinical setting for the early differential diagnosis of AD and for prediction of progression of MCI to dementia.",
